// The compiled-in dictionary catalogue. See `src/dictionary_registry.rs`.
//
// One entry per installable dictionary VARIANT. `id` is the `dict_language` value;
// `system_basenames` matches a system-installed copy under /usr/share/hunspell.
//
// Verified live (2026-07-15): every URL returned HTTP 200, every `SET` encoding was read from
// the `.aff`, every licence was read from the source. Sizes are the `.dic` Content-Length.
//
// Encoding note: pl-PL is ISO8859-2 and all three German dicts are ISO8859-1 (not UTF-8) — the
// loader (`spellcheck::read_pair`) transcodes from the `.aff` `SET` directive, so these load
// correctly whether downloaded or found on the system.
//
// French mapping follows the product decision "bare fr-FR = toutes variantes (tolerant)":
//   fr-FR            → toutes-variantes  (the default a French project gets)
//   fr-FR-x-classique → classique
//   fr-FR-x-1990     → réforme 1990
